    "text": "The set $S=\\{1,2,3, \\ldots, 12)$ is to be partitioned into three sets $A, B, C$ of equal size. Thus, $A \\cup B \\cup C=S, A \\cap B=B \\cap C=A \\cap C=\\phi$. The number of ways to partition $S$ is"
  },
